# BornTask brand

- Product name: **BornTask** (not Born Task, not borntask in UI copy except domains).
- Brand green `#178A5C` (logo tile). Strong `#0F6B46`. Tint `#E9F5EF`. Primary fill `#15845A`. Dark display green `#2FB57A`. Use `color.*` tokens, not raw hex.
- UI font: DM Sans. Display: Sora. Use `font.ui` / `font.display` from `apps/web/src/theme/tokens.ts`.
- Do not use kerd saffron (`#ffc629`), Archivo, or kerd token names (`--kd-*`).
- No emoji in product UI. Use the SVG icons already in `apps/web/src/components/Chips.tsx`.
- No new raw hex in screens. Add a token first, or use an existing one.
- British English in UI copy (organisation, colour, authorised, favourites).
- Hyphen `-` only in copy. No em dash or en dash.
